{"author":{"id":"baab9938d17c374ea6cceadec2cf8dfe966cceea1d7208ac14b0423eb5292995"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1779043861,"nonce":"K8Oer5Z26o6EQmytX7wp5cpY7UI=","title":"README `manualChunks` example crashes with rolldown (Vite 8)","message":"**Package version:** `@urutau-ltd/vite-plugin-librejs` v1.0.0  \n**Vite:** 8.0.13  \n**rolldown:** 1.0.1  \n**Node:** v22.22.2  \n\n## Description\n\nThe \"Complete Example\" in the README passes `manualChunks` as a plain object.\nRolldown 1.x rejects this form with a fatal `TypeError` at build time. The\nREADME example is broken as written against Vite 8.\n\n## Error\n\n```\nWarning: Invalid output options (1 issue found)\n- For the \"manualChunks\". Invalid type: Expected Function but received Object.\n\nTypeError: manualChunks is not a function\n    at name (rolldown/dist/shared/rolldown-build-BVD3dIdE.mjs:3067:10)\n    at name (rolldown/dist/shared/rolldown-build-BVD3dIdE.mjs:3078:54)\n```\n\n## Reproduction\n\n```ts\n// vite.config.ts — copied verbatim from the README \"Complete Example\"\nimport { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\nimport { librejsPlugin } from \"@urutau-ltd/vite-plugin-librejs\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  build: {\n    rollupOptions: {\n      output: {\n        manualChunks: { vendor: [\"./src/vendor.js\"] }, // ← object form\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [\n    librejsPlugin({\n      license: \"AGPL-3.0-or-later\",\n      sourceBase: \"https://example.com/src/\",\n      chunks: {\n        vendor: {\n          license: \"MIT\",\n          source: \"https://registry.npmjs.org/some-dep/-/some-dep-1.0.0.tgz\",\n        },\n      },\n    }),\n  ],\n});\n```\n\n```\nnpx vite build\n# → TypeError: manualChunks is not a function\n```\n\n## Root cause\n\nRollup accepted `manualChunks` as either an object (`Record\u003cstring,\nstring[]\u003e`) or a function. Rolldown dropped the object form and requires a\nfunction.\n\nThis is not a plugin bug — the plugin itself does not touch `manualChunks`.\nThe README example is what needs updating.\n\n## Fix\n\nReplace the object form with a function in the README:\n\n```diff\n-manualChunks: { vendor: [\"./src/vendor.js\"] }\n+manualChunks: (id) =\u003e id.includes(\"vendor\") ? \"vendor\" : undefined\n```\n\nUpdated \"Complete Example\":\n\n```ts\nimport { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\nimport { librejsPlugin } from \"@urutau-ltd/vite-plugin-librejs\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  build: {\n    sourcemap: false,\n    rollupOptions: {\n      output: {\n        manualChunks: (id) =\u003e id.includes(\"vendor\") ? \"vendor\" : undefined,\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [\n    librejsPlugin({\n      license: \"AGPL-3.0-or-later\",\n      sourceBase: \"https://example.com/src/\",\n      weblabelsPath: \"about/javascript.html\",\n      licensePageTitle: \"JavaScript license information\",\n      chunks: {\n        vendor: {\n          license: \"MIT\",\n          source: \"https://registry.npmjs.org/some-dep/-/some-dep-1.0.0.tgz\",\n        },\n      },\n    }),\n  ],\n});\n```","files":null}]}